OL,3,APassports needed for ferry passengers
OL,4,Atravelling between UK and Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreviously, passengers were able to use
OL,7,Fother forms of ID, such as driving
OL,8,Flicences and national identity cards -
OL,9,Fbut the changes are being brought in to
OL,10,Fcomply with UK Border Force rules.
